Cell["\<\
For a pseudoreal representation (which is self-dual), we also observe that \
the dual basis is ordered differently from the original basis.  \
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->2018685161,ExpressionUUID->"bd2cc9d3-e3cc-4d1e-b61b-08e137fd104e"],

